		{"id":"2803c59e6c76ac2d","type":"text","text":"1.给它数据","x":890,"y":-108,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"73a58e9ea5ebee2d","type":"text","text":" 机器学习流派的兴起（70年代）\n  [09:03](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1atCRYsE7x?t=543.501501#t=09:03.50)\n  训练机器只需要","x":1048,"y":51,"width":272,"height":80},
		{"id":"ffeee73ef4229710","type":"text","text":"卷积神经网络CNN\nLeNet-5（CNN原型：卷积+池化+全连接）","x":3600,"y":60,"width":250,"height":80},
		{"id":"f13872d06992b9bb","type":"text","text":"训练过程\n解释了机器怎么建立条件反射","x":1880,"y":91,"width":250,"height":84},
