		{"id":"33a65e30cb937bd8","type":"text","text":"专家系统\n [07:03](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1atCRYsE7x?t=423.806281#t=07:03.81) \n 根据人类专家的经验设置的专家系统","x":690,"y":220,"width":250,"height":122},
