		{"id":"13015cc5001fd628","type":"text","text":"联结主义\n[11:41](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1atCRYsE7x?t=701.076556#t=11:41.08) \n仿照自然界人脑神经元的连接方式，就可以实现像人一样的有学习能力的机器","x":1059,"y":264,"width":250,"height":146},
		{"id":"2b2a2dcfe3c735b6","type":"text","text":"图灵测试\n[05:19](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1atCRYsE7x?t=319.674727#t=05:19.67)\n机器如何表现出智能\n [05:42](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1atCRYsE7x?t=342.548133#t=05:42.55) \n","x":1060,"y":-261,"width":250,"height":124,"color":"2"},
