		{"id":"e08361f12399296b","type":"text","text":"1956年 达特茅斯会议\n[00:51](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1atCRYsE7x?t=51.804123#t=51.80)","x":284,"y":60,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a2bdb025461230b7","type":"text","text":"多层感知机**MLP**[^1]\n [26:01](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1atCRYsE7x?t=1561.035336#t=26:01.04) \n 解决了感知机无法进行异或操作的缺陷\n\n[^1]: MLP是FNN的一种具体实现形式，是FNN中最经典、最基础的一种结构，特指由全连接层组成的FNN\n","x":2480,"y":267,"width":260,"height":140},
